//! The campaign's effect graph.
//!
//! An effect adds `value` to its `kind` whenever every requirement holds.
//! Effects of one kind are summed in the order they appear here, which is the
//! order Freeciv evaluates them in. A `multiplier` scales the value by the
//! player's setting for that multiplier.

